# Next.js Environment Variables

# API Configuration
# Backend API. Set it to connect the app to the server (sign-in, catalogue, stock, purchases,
# POS sales and reports all come from the API). Leave it unset to run on this computer's own data
# (first-run setup / demo mode), as before. Local backend: cd backend && docker compose --profile api up
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:4000/api/v1

# Optional: Add any other environment variables your app needs
